{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"proposals\":[{\"actors\":[\"Securities and Futures Commission (SFC)\",\"licensed corporation subject to the Code of Conduct\",\"counterparties to a non-centrally cleared equity option transaction\",\"Hong Kong regulatory rulemaker gazetting the Code amendment\"],\"classification_assumptions\":[\"The assessed transaction is undertaken by a corporation that is licensed by the SFC and therefore within the circular's addressed population.\",\"“Non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options” is treated as the operative product category; overseas EU and UK materials are explanatory background rather than independent Hong Kong applicability conditions.\",\"The announced exemption is treated as operative from 2026-01-04 even though the Code amendment is stated to be gazetted later.\",\"“Until further notice” is treated as continuing unless a later SFC notice or effective amendment withdraws or changes it.\"],\"missing_information\":[\"Whether the assessed corporation is licensed by the SFC at the relevant time.\",\"The transaction's precise option category and whether it is centrally cleared.\",\"The transaction date and whether it is on or after 2026-01-04.\",\"Whether a later SFC notice or gazetted Code amendment has changed or terminated the announced exemption.\"],\"objects\":[\"SFC margin requirements under Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct\",\"A single-stock option, equity basket option or equity index option transaction\",\"The circular announcing the exemption\",\"The forthcoming amendment to paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10\"],\"reading\":{\"assumptions\":[\"The result addresses only the circular's announced Hong Kong exemption and does not determine any separate EU or UK legal requirement.\",\"A transaction satisfying all listed factual conditions is treated as within the announced exemption; the result does not confer licensing, regulatory approval or legal compliance generally.\"],\"citations\":[{\"quote\":\"The Securities and Futures Commission (SFC) issues this circular to inform licensed corporations that it will exempt non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options (collectively, “non-centrally cleared equity options”) from its margin requirements1 from 4 January 2026 until further notice to align with the latest global developments.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"},{\"quote\":\"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct will be amended accordingly and gazetted in due course.\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u6.1357\"},{\"quote\":\"1 As set out in Part III of Schedule 10 to the Code of Conduct for Persons Licensed by or Registered with the Securities and Futures Commission (Code of Conduct).\",\"unit_id\":\"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671\"}],\"distinction\":\"The factual condition for the Hong Kong exemption combines actor status (licensed corporation), product classification (single-stock, equity basket or equity index option), clearing status (non-centrally cleared), and time (from 2026-01-04 until further notice). EU and UK exemptions explain alignment but are not predicates in this model.\",\"family\":\"scope\",\"formalization\":{\"facts\":[{\"meaning\":\"The assessed corporation is licensed by or registered with the SFC and is a licensed corporation addressed by the circular.\",\"name\":\"corporation_is_sfc_licensed\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\",\"d802c45a4262c.u15.1671\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The transaction is a single-stock option, an equity basket option, or an equity index option.\",\"name\":\"option_is_covered_equity_type\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The transaction is not cleared through a central counterparty.\",\"name\":\"option_is_non_centrally_cleared\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"boolean\"},{\"meaning\":\"The transaction date is the Gregorian date on which the option transaction is assessed.\",\"name\":\"transaction_date\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"date\",\"unit\":\"Gregorian calendar date\"},{\"meaning\":\"The announced exemption start date is 2026-01-04.\",\"name\":\"exemption_start_date\",\"requires_judgment\":false,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"date\",\"unit\":\"Gregorian calendar date\"},{\"meaning\":\"The announced exemption remains in force at the assessment date because no later notice has withdrawn or altered it.\",\"name\":\"exemption_remains_until_further_notice\",\"requires_judgment\":true,\"source_unit_ids\":[\"d802c45a4262c.u0.0\"],\"type\":\"bool\",\"unit\":\"boolean\"}],\"result\":\"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] (and corporation_is_sfc_licensed option_is_covered_equity_type option_is_non_centrally_cleared (>= transaction_date exemption_start_date) exemption_remains_until_further_notice)\",\"result_type\":\"bool\",\"scope\":\"Whether the assessed transaction falls within the SFC-announced exemption from the specified margin requirements on the assessed date; true means the condition for announced exemption coverage is satisfied, false means at least one stated condition is not satisfied or the exemption is no longer in force.\"},\"local_id\":\"sfc_equity_option_exemption_scope\",\"questions\":[\"Has the assessed corporation's SFC licensing status been verified for the transaction date?\",\"What is the transaction's exact option type, clearing arrangement and date?\",\"Has any SFC notice or effective Code amendment changed the exemption since 2026-01-04?\"] ,\"statement\":\"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The assessed transaction satisfies the factual conditions for coverage by the SFC's announced margin exemption if it is entered into by an SFC-licensed corporation, is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket or equity index option, occurs on or after 2026-01-04, and the exemption remains in force until further notice.\" ,\"subject\":\"Applicability of the SFC-announced margin exemption to a specified Hong Kong equity-options transaction\"},\"relationships\":[\"The SFC addresses licensed corporations through the circular.\",\"The covered option categories are single-stock, equity basket and equity index options.\",\"The exemption applies to those options only when they are non-centrally cleared.\",\"The announced temporal window begins on 2026-01-04 and continues until further notice.\",\"Paragraph 7(e) of Part III of Schedule 10 is to be amended and gazetted in due course, so the announcement and the later Code text are temporally related but distinct sources.\"],\"schema_id\":\"sfc.margin_exemption.noncentrally_cleared_equity_options\",\"temporal_basis\":\"Assess the transaction on its transaction date; coverage begins 2026-01-04 and continues until a later SFC notice or effective amendment changes the position.\",\"unit_of_assessment\":\"One specified option transaction undertaken by one licensed corporation on one assessment date\"}],\"unresolved\":[]}"}}
